{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_chiave_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chiave_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "代表作",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chiave_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8b409ba06baff4e509ad546b69440494bf936954227f91474384f10ac8d8dc27",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "我一会儿让人把车开过来，你尽快把我的车修好，听懂了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "还有你们俩，奥斯塔，布洛卡，给我看住这个疯子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“看住”\n是说......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "别以为我不知道，已经有好几个手下向我报告过了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "“贾维把我的车修好了，可他把我的仪表盘改成了弹球游戏机！”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "“贾维把我的音响改成了外放的！对，把车里面的声音往车外面放的！我和我老婆打的电话被别人听得一清二楚！”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "所以，看住他，除了把我的车恢复原样，我禁止他对我的车做任何改动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "要是敢出一点差错，你们，还有你们的修车厂......统统都要给我的女士陪葬。记住了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "记住了，老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "可你的女士是谁？我们刚刚提过她吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "她就是车，车就是她，蠢货！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "我真不该期待你能理解一个人对自己座驾的感情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "尤其是当她带着自己出生入死，为自己挡下无数危险......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "嗯，我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "你明白个*叙拉古问候语*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "总之，等我来提车时，我要看到一个完好无损的她——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "一辆完好无损的车！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "林顿先生，您不坐坐再走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "以你们两个的能力，为什么要跟这种脑子有病的家伙待在一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "林顿先生，我想您没必要总是和我讨论这个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "既然你们铁了心跟贾维混，与其在我身上浪费时间，不如好好想想该怎么让他正常一点，免得他把你们也拖下水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "奥斯塔，布洛卡，我们这下可要在怀特城扬名立万了！我们要修的是全怀特城只此一辆的豪车！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......这会不会是个阴谋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "别担心，林顿真的迫切需要一个厉害的人帮他修车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "前几天林顿被人伏击，他的车被打得千疮百孔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "不过那可是找遍叙拉古都没几辆的顶级豪车，防弹性能一流，最后救了他一命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "但是......为什么要让我们修？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "因为贾维确实是怀特城里技术最好的修车工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哼，奥斯塔，就算你夸我，我也不会把车借你开的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "借我开？你什么时候成车主了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "布洛卡，拿着这张材料单，把上面的东西采购回来。要是能在半小时内回来，我可以考虑把车借你开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "借我开就免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "贾维，你可别想着修好之后把车开出去兜风这种蠢事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你前脚把车开上怀特城的街道，后脚就有人去告诉林顿，不出一个小时，我们的修车厂就会被砸成一堆破烂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "那算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我谢谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不过，要是这车只有林顿能开，我就只能让林顿自己摸索我的改造成果了，真遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你还想在车上搞改装？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "你自己说的，那可是“找遍叙拉古都没几辆的顶级豪车”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "超轻底盘，超大功率引擎，完美的空气动力学设计......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我有预感，只有这辆车能实现我一直以来的梦想！这是我这辈子仅此一次的机会！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......你到底要改什么啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "现在告诉你就没意思了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "等到林顿来提车的那一天，我要给所有人一个做梦都想不到的惊喜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "布洛卡，你这么快就回来啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "快来，让我看看你买的改装件——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "唔唔唔嗯嗯噫呜呜呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "奥斯塔！你捂我嘴干什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "老大的车我给你们开过来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我们马上把车运进汽修车间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "然后，贾维，老大让我提醒你一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "好说好说，什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "老大说，如果车修好之后让他发现一丁点改装的痕迹，他就把你砌进修车厂地下室的墙里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "呃，还有别的事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "这几天我就住你们这里了。老大让我全程跟进你们修车这件事，免得你们偷偷捣鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，你回来得正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "快，带这位朋友去参观修车厂的生活区，他要在我们这里住几天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "这是林顿先生的心腹，你可得把以前搞暗杀时那套习惯收一收。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "伤了他就不好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "什么暗杀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "等等，你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "带你参观。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "你......你别乱来！我是林顿先生派过来的，你敢动我你就完了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "别、别拉我，我自己能走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（擦汗）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "贾维，现在你知道了，你敢改林顿的车，就要被他砌进地下室的墙里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "所以，老老实实把他的车修好，别想着改装了，算我欠你个人情，行不行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "但是让你欠我人情没什么意思啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......那你想让谁欠你人情？林顿？就凭你在他严令禁止的前提下改了他的车？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我现在就去告诉林顿你脑袋被机油熏坏了，半年不能开工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "别——别！奥斯塔，你听我说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我是说真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你是真的想被林顿砌进墙里，我已经知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我是说，真的，奥斯塔，没准我以后再也遇不上这么好的车了，这真的是一生只有一次的机会！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "你们两个可以在改装完成之前先逃走，我一个人对付林顿，你们等林顿对我心服口服之后再回来！我就不信他不被我的创意折服！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "就算林顿真的是个一点审美都没有的蠢货，看到那么伟大的改装还非要把我砌进墙里不可，那我也认了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "这真的是我能做到的最最伟大的改装了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "你可是我的好小弟，别让我记恨你一辈子啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（叹气声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "反正这种事上我从来拦不住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "记得躲着点林顿的那个眼线，白天老实修车，最好等他睡了再搞你的改装，我和布洛卡会替你打掩护的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "怎么样，小爷我的技术厉害吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "确实，短短几天就能修到现在这个程度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维&奥斯塔&布洛卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "而且......好像确实没什么改装的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "我上车看看可以吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "贾维？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "没问题，看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "座椅......内饰......仪表盘......都没问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "车载音响......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "贾维，这个播放按钮怎么回事？老大给我的照片上可不是红色的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "那个是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "我告诉你们几个，要是真敢在老大的车上捣鬼，我可没法手下留情！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "我可要按下去了，你最好在事情变得不可收拾之前老实坦白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "那你就按吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无论你走到哪儿 家族都会找到你 噢噢♪\n不管你多快 不管你多慢 噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "所以你就把音响的播放按钮换了个红的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "你和老大的品味还真是相得益彰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿的心腹",
      "text": "时间不早了，老大明早来提车，我先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "贾维，你的改装......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "完全没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你确定能藏得那么好？刚才那家伙不就看出播放按钮有问题了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "藏？为什么要藏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "刚刚那家伙没什么眼力，你让我瞒着他，我也就忍了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "但林顿既然买了这辆车，就一定能理解我煞费苦心的改装！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "所以你的改装多半瞒不过林顿，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "别说得那么难听嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "应该是“一眼就能发现我改装的伟大之处”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "平静，平静，奥斯塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "好，贾维，现在我需要你告诉我，你准备的惊喜到底是什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不是说好了要保密吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我要你现在就告诉我，我才能帮你想一个尽量不触怒林顿的对策。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "还是别了吧，我觉得会破坏你明天的惊喜体验——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你现在不说，等到林顿来给我们一个惊喜，我们就全完了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "看在你这么急的份儿上，你把耳朵凑过来，我偷偷告诉你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "布洛卡，你没奥斯塔这么急，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，去收拾我们所有值钱的东西，然后找一辆最快的车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "要逃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "以最快的速度赶紧逃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "还有你，贾维，别愣着了，赶紧收拾东西，把你觉得重要的东西都带走！我们得顶着林顿的眼线冲出怀特城了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我不走，不是说了嘛，林顿一定会理解我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "他理解个——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我这么说，贾维，就算林顿理解，他也不可能容忍！你要是不想被砌进墙里就赶紧收拾东西赶紧跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我和布洛卡还好说，你才是会实打实地没命的那个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "那你们两个先走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你呢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我不能走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我要是和你们一起走了，我的改装就永远没人知道了。我舍不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "要不然就只能把那辆豪车开走，可林顿虽然人品不怎么样，但他还没对我们干什么坏事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "他挺喜欢那辆车的，我改装是想给他一个惊喜，不是偷他的车，让他因为高血压晕过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你——\n唉！布洛卡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "把贾维绑起来带走！我这里有绳子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "布洛卡刚刚不是去收拾东西了吗？要我把他给你叫过来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我再......想想吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "（均匀的呼噜声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "奥斯塔，十点了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "是啊，十点了。亏他还能睡着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "他不光不怕林顿，连我们俩趁他睡着把他绑走都不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果天亮之前想不到好办法——\n等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我想到了！我想到了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，等贾维醒了告诉他，明天按原计划进行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "让他一定要把那个惊喜做到十二分......不，二十分！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，车我给你开过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "贾维，你确实是城里最好的修车工。至少在修车这一点上，我没找错人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "等我回了办公室，再考虑给你们多少报酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我不用报酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "怎么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "只要能让我再开一段，帮你把车开回去就行，用这个当报酬就足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "真不要钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "那太好了。要是从车库里开过来不够过瘾，你就直接把我送回办公室吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "今天没看到奥斯塔啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我也没看到他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "我早上可听说，昨天夜里，奥斯塔从你的修车厂开着辆车出去了。过了不久，布洛卡也走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "啧啧啧，真不够朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "但他们至少还算聪明人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林顿的目光落在二人中间的红色按钮上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "你能骗过我那个笨蛋手下，但你骗不过我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "音响的播放按钮为什么是圆的，周围还带一圈防滑纹，能不能请你给我解释一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "这个嘛——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "因为这是个旋钮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "旋钮！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "告诉我，你在这个旋钮上附加了什么功能？总不至于是音量旋钮吧，那也太不贾维了——\n我说得对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，我觉得与其跟你解释，不如让我亲自示范一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "承认了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "那家伙向我报告的时候，我还以为你转性了，没想到还是旧习难改。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "老老实实把车开到我的办公室，然后等待发落！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "不许做任何多余的事，尤其是不许碰那个红色旋钮。我会紧紧盯着你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "可这样就没音乐听了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "在听音乐之前，小子，先想好遗书怎么写吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "前面右转。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，你这辆车的手感真不错，要不然我也不会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "现在恭维我已经晚了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "怎么回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "*叙拉古问候语*，又搞这一套？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "贾维，该不会是你把那帮人引来的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "*丰富多彩的叙拉古问候语*，这可是小爷我刚修好的车！你们疯了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "（小声）看来不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "要不是还有事没做，我现在就撞烂你们这帮*叙拉古粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "小心那边的汽油桶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "看到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "（拍方向盘）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哈哈，孬种，这下炸到自己人了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "别松懈，他们还有车跟在后面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "知道！我看得一清二楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "不远了，我们就快到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，在那之前，我还有件事要请求你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "有什么事之后再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不行，你必须现在答应我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "如果是改装的事，我们已经一笔......一笔勾销了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不，老大，不是这个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "那还能是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "在我被砌进地下室的墙里之前，我要亲眼看着你把搞伏击的这帮混蛋带到我面前来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我要让他们哭着给她道歉！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "“她”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "就是这辆车！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "这辆我没日没夜地改了一整个星期的车！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "等等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "等等，那是什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "他们居然开了一辆卡车横在路口？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "快减速，蠢货，要撞上去了，再加速就撞上去了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而贾维的手死死握在打正的方向盘上，油门也丝毫未松。\n卡车的车身眼看越来越近。\n慌不择路的林顿试图抢下贾维的方向盘，与此同时，贾维把手伸向了汽车音响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "你？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "贾维把旋钮一拧到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无论你走到哪儿 家族都会找到你 噢噢♪\n不管你多快 不管你多慢 噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "你还有心情放......音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "乐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "音乐开始的同时，咆哮的引擎声很快盖过了豪华车载音响播放的流行歌曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "与此同时，林顿感到一阵前所未有的颠簸，加速度把他死死按在座椅上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而豪车外面的人们看见，车身两侧伸出短短的滑翔翼，车底喷出黑烟，车顶迅速打开，里面钻出两架展开之后大得超乎想象的无人机——\n整辆汽车摇摇晃晃地飞了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "清晨你对着火并肆虐后的景象哭泣 噢噢♪\n你明明渐入佳境 却突然开始失控 噢~噢~噢噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，你车上都是些什么歌啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我切首更适合这个伟大时刻的歌，你没意见吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林顿脸色发白，整个人僵在座椅上一动不动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃莱娜 我的名字是埃莱娜♪\n我是一名鲁珀♪\n和其他的鲁珀一样♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不对，这首也俗得要命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "今夜无人入眠 今夜无人入眠♪\n高贵的女士 连你也是一样♪\n你要在寂寥寒冷的房间♪\n心急如焚地观望 那因梦想而闪烁的星光♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "这首勉强凑合吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "......着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "你......你给我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "（牙齿打颤声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "等......着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哦，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "但是我真没想到这两架改大了的无人机能支撑这么远——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "——比我预期的多坚持了十几秒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，我们要降落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "降......落......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "就是“掉下去”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "掉下去？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "你放心，我会尽量让这个过程缓和一点的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两架无人机在空中相继散架，汽车底部喷出的黑烟渐渐散去。\n伴着令人热泪盈眶的音乐，还有林顿撕心裂肺的尖叫声，汽车开始向下俯冲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "老大，我们到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "到、到、到......到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我都说了，你放心就好，落地时的减震可是我花心思最多的地方，一定能平安降落的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "平安......降落......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "......她呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林顿没再理睬贾维，颤抖着手拧了拧插在孔里的车钥匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "她彻底离你而去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "贾维！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "给我等着，我马上就把你砌进——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者A",
      "text": "林顿先生，林顿先生！我是《怀特城邮报》的记者，请问这次飞行实验是您的主意还是这位贾维先生的主意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者B",
      "text": "请问您是特意为了这次实验而购买了这辆豪车吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者C",
      "text": "请问您在实验开始之前的心情如何？您在空中有没有什么特别的感受？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者D",
      "text": "我们刚刚注意到，您的车在实验开始之前似乎遭到了伏击，请问这是为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "林顿先生，这当然是您自己的主意对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "呃......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "至于这辆豪车，则是林顿先生为了这次伟大的实验忍痛提供的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "呃，是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "毅然决然地把车交给贾维，一切都是为了确保实验能安全完成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "（数次深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "没错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "至于在空中的心情......在杰出歌唱家歌声的陪伴之下，我俯视着怀特城的街景，那是何等的心潮澎湃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林顿",
      "text": "而那些来伏击我的家伙，不过是一帮不肯抬头仰望星空的宵小罢了，甚至不值得去关注......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者A",
      "text": "贾维先生，作为这次实验的实际执行者，您的感想如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "棒极了！我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "奥斯塔，都怪你，报纸上整版都是昨天林顿那家伙大谈特谈的飞行心得，我只有一张被布洛卡打晕的丑脸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "话也不能这么说，毕竟车确实是林顿的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "从面子上讲，你完成了“他的计划”，让他成了怀特城的大发明家，生平第一次上法治新闻以外的版面，他没理由对你动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "至于里子，他的车被你毁了，但你反过来救了他一条命，在我看来，无论如何也扯平了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "当然，那群搞伏击的家伙也来得真是时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我半夜去找记者的时候只想着让他为了面子没法动手。可没想到，你这改装居然还能把自己变成他的救命恩人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我还是不甘心啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "豪车以后没准还有，小爷我这样的脑瓜可是绝无仅有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "赞成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "嗯？布洛卡，你是在夸我对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "贾维，你要是还不服气，我可以告诉你，他在半空中伴着音乐嚎得很惨，我在他办公楼门口都听见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "顺便，还有件事没上报纸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你在怀特城已经有新外号了，虽然是和林顿共享的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "请进！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的市民",
      "text": "请问是“飞天者”贾维的修车厂吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的市民",
      "text": "我也要给自己的车来个超酷的改装！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
